# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# ============================================================================
# Type:     feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore, ci, revert
# Scope:    component/area affected (optional)
# Subject:  imperative, lowercase, no period, max 50 chars
# Body:     explain what and why (not how), wrap at 72 chars
# Footer:   reference issues: Closes #123, Fixes #456
# ============================================================================
# Example:
#
# feat(auth): add jwt token validation
#
# The auth middleware now validates JWT tokens against
# the issuer's public key and checks expiration.
#
# Closes #1234
# ============================================================================
